@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@adminToken = token-do-endpointow-badawczych

### Basic liveness check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Deeper ops health check (DB connectivity + service count)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ops/health

### Warm up query planner / connections before a measurement run
GET {{baseUrl}}/ops/warmup

### Quick reset — clears orders only (between repetitions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ops/admin/reseed
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
